      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The new internal memo requires an immediate shift from our $Q4$ financial strategy, which focuses on algorithmic trading, to a cash-only approach. We must liquidate all existing positions across all assets within the next 48 hours and halt all autonomous trading operations instantly. The significant operational change involves our trading team, financial analysts, and risk management departments to adjust their workflows to align with the new high-liquidity requirements. Our risk and compliance teams need to provide additional support to ensure that all liquidated assets are appropriately managed and the trading systems are taken offline without any undue risk exposure. This decision might affect our profit margins in the short term due to the halt in trading operations. However, it will ensure us full compliance with the updated institution risk policy.",
